cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Explainable FVIII Inhibitor Risk Classification in Hemophilia A
  using F8 Genomic Variant Data
message: >-
  If you use this software or its findings, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Dipak
    family-names: Chaudhari
    affiliation: PES University
  - given-names: Tejas
    family-names: Nagmote
    affiliation: PES University
