    affiliation: PES University
  - given-names: Varsha
    family-names: P
    affiliation: PES University
repository-code: 'https://github.com/dchaudhari7177/hemophilia'
abstract: >-
  A leakage-free, calibrated genomic risk model for FVIII inhibitor
  development in hemophilia A, built on the CDC CHAMP database and
  validated zero-shot on the CDC CHBMP hemophilia B cohort. Includes
  a forensic audit showing that previously published accuracies on
  this dataset (97.37% and 99.63%) are artifacts of over-sampling
  before the train/test split, relabelling unrecorded outcomes as
  negative, and using near-unique identifier columns as features.
keywords:
  - hemophilia A
  - factor VIII inhibitors
  - F8
  - clinical prediction model
  - data leakage
  - model calibration
  - explainable AI
license: MIT
